{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"他忽然昂扬而坦荡，仿佛即使仍无把握，也能挺直身子继续向前。\",\n      \"why\": \"S11让他切身分清，重新有力量不等于已经安顿；因此这份挺立不必替未定给出答案，而能成为继续向前的力量。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M3\", \"M7\", \"M23\", \"M30\", \"M31\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"昂扬里仍有悲伤与柔软，热烈中又忽然掠过一阵心酸。\",\n      \"why\": \"S11已让他发现，未定、柔软与行动可以并存；S08、S10又表明，亲切的回返并不能带来安顿，所以心酸仍会浮起，却不必让脚步停下。\",\n      \"from\": [\"S08\", \"S10\", \"S11\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M8\", \"M30\", \"M35\", \"M39\", \"M41\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，行动带来的力量不只让停滞松开，也能变成坦荡的昂扬与自豪；一瞬心酸再现时，这份力量仍没有消散。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa9267e0-6fbe-4cbe-b4f9-e63ebe5ee39d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T222721649528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.829, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T22:28:57.482705+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0285cce13e1fd6c1e0f67c821fe9dd918d884015c7c9d35735ed88b7e8961d67", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "